# Remaining Acceptance Work — All 27 Rows

This is a complete reconciliation of current execution-state owners, not a new whole-source audit. Completed October31 work is not listed as pending. Local follow-ups below are still unexecuted and need separate bounded real-task packets; external targets must not be invented.

| Scenario | Skill | Next work class | Owner | Exact prerequisite / remaining evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| CEOPT-01 | autoresearch | Local task packet and execution evidence remain feasible | Acceptance executor and orchestration task owner | Bind an actual check/recovery task, original state snapshots and canonical orchestrator commands; execute recovery and compare state without treating scorer fixtures as orchestration proof. |
| CEOPT-04 | spec-commit | Bounded Git controls complete; broader host/mixed-index task remains | Task caller and Git integration owner | Exact authorized target, preservation strategy and actual autonomous/mixed-index evidence beyond the admitted fixture. |
| CEOPT-06 | spec-compound | Local task packet and execution evidence remain feasible | Acceptance executor and knowledge publication owner | Supplement independently reviewed with original citation/drift limitations retained. Execute distinct interrupted/unknown-validator and autonomous promotion facets with attributable live source; parent guards are not native runtime enforcement. |
| CEOPT-07 | spec-compound-refresh | Local task packet and execution evidence remain feasible | Acceptance executor and knowledge refresh publication owner | Supplement independently reviewed; native claims check covers0 references, so explicit source hashes/links own that evidence. Unknown-validator, autonomous/live consumer and native enforcement facets remain open. |
| CEOPT-08 | spec-debug | Local task packet and execution evidence remain feasible | Acceptance executor and proof-preservation task owner | Mediated repaired-process to Simplify handoff and seven paired checksum reruns completed November1. Actual autonomous execution and separately justified substantive refactor remain open. |
| CEOPT-10 | spec-dogfood | Actual external target, human input, or host evidence required | Acceptance executor and host browser integration owner | All six bounded receipt interpretations independently reviewed. Supply actual authorized branch/diff and autonomous browser-owner task with source/build freshness, focus/visual/journey evidence and genuine owner feedback for full acceptance. |
| CEOPT-11 | spec-explain | Local task packet and execution evidence remain feasible | Acceptance executor and artifact destination owner | All three B-r2 parent deliveries independently reviewed. Obtain actual model-authored destination/autonomous save and interaction/visual evidence; parent navigation appendix remains separate. |
| CEOPT-12 | spec-handoff | Local task packet and execution evidence remain feasible | Acceptance executor and handoff producer owner | Exercise model-authored handoff generation and durable save with stage/unstaged preservation; current six consumer continuations use B-helper-produced handoffs and cannot compare A/B producers. |
| CEOPT-13 | spec-ideate | Actual external target, human input, or host evidence required | Acceptance executor and tracker integration owner | Bind an authorized real tracker export/pagination task and autonomous dossier publication; fixture exports and separately budgeted successor remain limited evidence. |
| CEOPT-14 | spec-lfg | Actual external target, human input, or host evidence required | Repository PR owner and acceptance executor | All six bounded interpretations independently reviewed with complete observation/feedback/recovery coverage. Supply an exact authorized sandbox PR and scoped publication/reply/resolution actions for actual disconnected-write recovery, plus genuine typed decision evidence/owner answer and real continuous observations. Preserve recovered truncations and no relative-benefit claim. |
